WEBVTT

00:12:59.585 --> 00:13:01.698
But if there's common ground
to be had there,

00:13:01.722 --> 00:13:03.290
yeah, I'll partner with them.

00:13:03.992 --> 00:13:05.472
It's not easy.

00:13:06.027 --> 00:13:09.227
The approach means
we need to find love.

00:13:09.251 --> 00:13:11.284
We need to get back
to that shared humanity

00:13:11.308 --> 00:13:12.461
and that commons.

00:13:12.485 --> 00:13:13.667
But I know this love,

00:13:13.691 --> 00:13:16.074
it doesn't just get us through
Thanksgiving dinner.

00:13:16.098 --> 00:13:18.125
It's the kind of love
that secures freedom,

00:13:18.149 --> 00:13:19.984
changes the world.

00:13:20.008 --> 00:13:21.558
But to do that,

00:13:21.582 --> 00:13:23.976
I have to step into my courage,

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.374
and I want all of you
to step into your courage.

00:13:26.774 --> 00:13:28.544
Just like that Muslim family

00:13:28.568 --> 00:13:32.067
stepped into their courage
for my Hindu family all those years ago.